	(text "C2 calculations\nThe purpose of C2 is to constrain the bandwidth to 18MHz\nOPA381's datasheet \ngives 2 formulas for C2:\n2. 1/(2π * Rf * (Cf + C STRAY) = \nsquare root of [ (GBW/4π* Rf * CTOT) ]\n\n2. CTOT = CDiode + 2.5 pF + 1 pF\n\nGiven values from datasheet:\n1. CTOT = 40 pF + 2.5 pF + \n1 pF = 43.5 pF\n2. C STRAY = 0.2 pF\n3. GBW of OPA381= 18MHz\n\nRf=100k ohms\n\nPlugging all of these into the above formula and isolating C2 (Cf), we get C2 = 2.7pF. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.628 110.744 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "06f8113f-0239-420b-9c9d-0ef92886f2fa")
	)
	(text "Photodiode's R44 will be a placeholder. Determined at component testing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56.388 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "098ff509-e0f9-4cf9-bec7-fdb2407c1d68")
	)
